@bank all
// Pillar 5 (head writer, seat W): crew remarks for Step 2 (bubbles or card lines, 60 characters).
// clothes.grubby: someone notices your grubby uniform (seat M1 sets flag:clothes.grubby). Friends kindly.
// inc.thanks: the crew member you helped out of the stuck lift (said to you for a few days; seat M2).
// haul.thanks: whoever receives a manifest crate at their stop (Rina at the infirmary, Yara at the store).

== clothes.grubby
? flag:clothes.grubby
- Been wrestling an oven? You've got it all down you.   #funny
- Bit of oil there. And there. And, well, everywhere.   #funny
- Busy morning? The wardrobe's calling you.
? flag:clothes.grubby tier>=friend
- Change before Calder sees you. Trust me.   #warm

== inc.thanks
- You got me out of the lift. I owe you a tea. Several.   #warm
- Still thinking about that lift. Thanks for coming.
- I'll take the ladder for a bit. No offence to the lift.   #funny

== haul.thanks
- Oh, lovely. Just where I wanted it.
- Delivery! You're a star. Put it there, by the wall.
- That's this week's lot. Thank you.
